cpa-plugin-privacyfilter provenance and attribution
================================================

This repository is the ahoo security-hardened fork of the original CLIProxyAPI
Privacy Filter plugin by rheodev (Frank). The original repository and upstream
base retained in this Git history are:

- https://github.com/rheodev/cpa-plugin-privacyfilter
- original initialization commit d1002dc44927d267dfdbaf40437dd9685465613a
- upstream v0.2.0 base a3db9d1f951d6d34cf7f00029cb71ff46a600d1f

The root MIT license preserves Frank's copyright. The hardening and release work
