from PackyMe/privacy-filter at the immutable commit below:

- https://github.com/PackyMe/privacy-filter/commit/64b8de3c206059b187d65381189b70c267550392

Those portions are used under the MIT License. The PackyMe copyright and full
license are preserved in internal/privacyengine/LICENSE and in the generated
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md report.

