Embedded Gitleaks rules
-----------------------

rules/gitleaks.toml is the exact default Gitleaks v8.30.0 rule snapshot at:

- repository: https://github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks
- source commit: 6eaad039603a4de39fddd1cf5f727391efe9974e
- source path: config/gitleaks.toml
- SHA-256: e163e53b9e7e8a8511e77271e2b323ed057759542a6d988258afe3a1fa329caf

The snapshot is embedded as data and is used under the Gitleaks MIT License.
The Zachary Rice copyright and full license are preserved at
third_party/gitleaks.LICENSE and in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md. The immutable
fetch-and-hash procedure is scripts/update-rules.sh.

Linked dependencies
-------------------

THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md is generated from the exact Go modules linked into this
plugin plus the bundled components above. Its generator is
.github/scripts/generate-license-report.py. CI regenerates and compares the
report so dependency or license changes cannot silently leave it stale.
